('0890565001', '0890565', 'SELVAGE REGULAR 5PKT', 'Trousers', 'Garment Lower body', 'Denim', 'Blue', 'Light', 'Denim trousers', 'Menswear', 'Menswear', 'Denim Men', 'Trousers Denim', '5-pocket, slim-fit jeans in washed, stretch cotton denim with a regular waist, zip fly and button and gently tapered legs with good room for movement over the thighs and knees. The jeans are made from selvedge denim – a high-quality denim woven on traditional shuttle looms with a distinctive red/white selvedge that stops the fabric from unravelling. The cotton content of the jeans is partly recycled.', NULL, 0, 0),
