('0891665001', '0891665', 'Blake MJ school SG', 'Ballerinas', 'Shoes', 'Solid', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Kids Girl Shoes', 'Children Accessories, Swimwear', 'Baby/Children', 'Kids & Baby Shoes', 'Shoes', 'Low-heeled shoes in imitation patent leather with round toes a strap with a hook and loop fastening over the foot and a small loop at the back. Linings and patterned insoles in a cotton weave and chunky, patterned soles.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0891667001', '0891667', 'Gisele chainbelt', 'Belt', 'Accessories', 'Solid', 'White', 'Light', 'Belts', 'Ladies Accessories', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Big accessories', 'Accessories', 'Narrow, metal chain belt with a small, detachable bag in imitation leather. Belt with an adjustable carabiner hook fastening. Bag with a flap and press-stud and four internal card compartments. Width of bag 10 cm. Height 7 cm.', NULL, 0, 0),
