('0893106001', '0893106', 'Frank Cargo Tech Pants', 'Trousers', 'Garment Lower body', 'Solid', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Men Sport Tops', 'Sport', 'Sport', 'Men H&M Sport', 'Outdoor', 'Sports joggers in heavy jersey with taped details. Elasticated, drawstring waist, zipped side pockets and flap leg pockets. Tapered legs with shaping seams at the knees for added mobility and wide ribbing at the hems. The polyester content of the joggers is recycled.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0893119001', '0893119', 'Ubbe Softshell Anorak', 'Jacket', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Men Sport Tops', 'Sport', 'Sport', 'Men H&M Sport', 'Outdoor', 'Softshell popover jacket in windproof, water-repellent functional fabric with folded seams. Lined hood and a zip and wind flap with a hook and loop fastening at the top. Diagonal, zipped front pockets, an adjustable hook and loop fastening at the cuffs, and an elasticated drawstring at the hem. Slightly longer at the back. Lined. The jacket has a water-repellent coating without fluorocarbons.', NULL, 0, 0),
