('0893141001', '0893141', 'Sandy', 'Sweater', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Knitwear', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Everyday Collection', 'Knitwear', 'Oversized jumper in a soft knit containing some wool with dropped shoulders, long sleeves, a rounded hem and ribbing around the neckline, cuffs and hem. Longer at the back. The polyester content of the jumper is recycled.', NULL, 0, 0),
