('0895506002', '0895506', 'AVRIL DRESS', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'All over pattern', 'Dark Pink', 'Bright', 'Dresses', 'Divided', 'Divided', 'Divided Collection', 'Dresses Ladies', 'Short, sleeveless dress in a patterned weave with frill-trimmed, elasticated shoulder straps and a wrapover front with flounces at the top. Elasticated seam at the waist and a flounced trim at the hem. Unlined.', NULL, 0, 0),
