('0896278001', '0896278', 'MAMA Roxy tankini.', 'Bikini top', 'Swimwear', 'Solid', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Swimwear', 'Lingeries/Tights', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Swimwear, beachwear', 'Swimwear', 'Fully lined tankini top with a wrapover top section and gently draped front for best fit over the tummy. Padded cups that shape the bust and provide good support, adjustable shoulder straps and concealed elastication under the bust for added support. The polyester content of the top is partly recycled.', NULL, 0, 0),
