('0904829001', '0904829', 'PQ IONA TENCEL DRESS', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'Solid', 'Dark Yellow', 'Dark', 'Woven Premium', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Premium', 'Unknown', 'Sleeveless, knee-length dress woven in a Tencel™ lyocell blend with a sheen. Narrow cut at the top and a wide smocked section at the hips. Lined.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0904834001', '0904834', 'PQ HOUSTON TENCEL TRS', 'Trousers', 'Garment Lower body', 'Solid', 'Green', 'Medium Dusty', 'Woven Premium', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Premium', 'Unknown', 'Trousers in a Tencel™ lyocell and cotton weave. High waist with an extended waistband and concealed hook-and-eye fastener, and a zip fly. Pockets in the side seams, flap back pockets, and tapered legs with sewn-in creases.', NULL, 0, 0),
