('0908917001', '0908917', 'Dolce dress Petite', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'Solid', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Dress', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Tailoring', 'Dresses Ladies', 'Fitted, sleeveless, knee-length dress in a stretch weave with a round neckline and a concealed zip at the back. Seam at the waist and a close-fitting skirt with decorative buttons and a slit at the front of the hem. Unlined.', NULL, 0, 0);
