('0909357001', '0909357', 'Rome Maxi Dress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'All over pattern', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Projects Dresses', 'Divided', 'Divided', 'Divided Projects', 'Dresses Ladies', 'Long dress in an airy viscose weave with a scallop-trimmed V-neck and covered buttons at the top. Long sleeves with a small puff at the shoulders and narrow elastication at the cuffs. Concealed zip in one side, and gathered seams with a narrow velvet trim under the bust and around the skirt for added volume. Unlined.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0909358001', '0909358', 'Mara dress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'All over pattern', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Projects Dresses', 'Divided', 'Divided', 'Divided Projects', 'Dresses Ladies', 'Short dress in an airy, patterned weave with a round, frill-trimmed neckline and small opening at the back with a button at the back of the neck. Long sleeves with pleats at the top for added volume, a seam at the waist with narrow, concealed elastication, and a double-layered skirt with an asymmetric top layer. Lined.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0909358002', '0909358', 'Mara dress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'All over pattern', 'Dark Red', 'Dark', 'Projects Dresses', 'Divided', 'Divided', 'Divided Projects', 'Dresses Ladies', 'Short dress in an airy, patterned weave with a round, frill-trimmed neckline and small opening at the back with a button at the back of the neck. Long sleeves with pleats at the top for added volume, a seam at the waist with narrow, concealed elastication, and a double-layered skirt with an asymmetric top layer. Lined.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0909370001', '0909370', 'FF PI Haley dress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'Jacquard', 'Off White', 'Dusty Light', 'Campaigns', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Everyday Collection', 'Special Offers', 'Short, A-line dress in a jacquard weave made from recycled polyester. Double-layered stand-up collar with pleats and a V-shaped opening at the front, long puff sleeves and gathered tiers to the hem for added width in the skirt. Unlined.', '/products/0909370001.jpg', 1, 472),
('0909371001', '0909371', 'FF PI Mary dress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'Lace', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Campaigns', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Everyday Collection', 'Special Offers', 'Knee-length dress in recycled polyester lace with a stand-up collar and an opening at the back with buttons at the back of the neck. Long sleeves, a seam at the hips and a flared skirt with an asymmetric hem. Overlocked edges at the cuffs and hem. Unlined.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0909409002', '0909409', 'Flirty Simon hoop', 'Earring', 'Accessories', 'Solid', 'Light Pink', 'Dusty Light', 'Jewellery', 'Ladies Accessories', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Small accessories', 'Accessories', 'Metal hoop earrings decorated with stone-like plastic beads and glass rhinestones.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0909427001', '0909427', 'LENNY HW bermuda', 'Shorts', 'Garment Lower body', 'Treatment', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Shorts', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Everyday Collection', 'Shorts', 'Wide, knee-length shorts in imitation leather with a high waist, pleats at the front, zip fly with concealed hook-and-eye fasteners and diagonal side pockets. The polyester content of the pocket lining is partly recycled.', NULL, 0, 0),
