('0911344001', '0911344', 'ED Sorelli Petite Dress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'Solid', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Woven top', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'H&M+', 'Blouses', 'Calf-length kaftan in an airy viscose weave with a small, gathered stand-up collar and a V-shaped opening at the top. Concealed buttons down the front and short sleeves.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0911405002', '0911405', 'Lana Seamless Hotpant', 'Shorts', 'Garment Lower body', 'Solid', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Ladies Sport Bottoms', 'Sport', 'Sport', 'Ladies H&M Sport', 'Jersey Fancy', 'Shorts in fast-drying functional fabric with a high waist and wide, elasticated ribbing at the waist. The shorts are designed with the minimum number of seams for a more comfortable fit and increased mobility.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0911410001', '0911410', 'Cat tee', 'T-shirt', 'Garment Upper body', 'Embroidery', 'Black', 'Dark', 'OL Extended Sizes', 'Divided', 'Divided', 'Divided Basics', 'Jersey Basic', 'T-shirt in soft cotton jersey with a small embroidered text motif on the front and a round, rib-trimmed neckline.', NULL, 0, 0),
