('0911436001', '0911436', 'ED Angel dress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'Solid', 'White', 'Light', 'Woven top', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'H&M+', 'Blouses', 'Short dress in a cotton weave with a square neckline. Short puff sleeves with narrow elastication over the shoulders and at the hems. Seam at the waist and a flared skirt with gathered tiers. Unlined.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0911436003', '0911436', 'ED Angel dress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'Solid', 'Dark Pink', 'Bright', 'Woven top', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'H&M+', 'Blouses', 'Short dress in a cotton weave with a square neckline. Short puff sleeves with narrow elastication over the shoulders and at the hems. Seam at the waist and a flared skirt with gathered tiers. Unlined.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0911445001', '0911445', 'DRAPER ROLLER NECK', 'Cardigan', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'Off White', 'Dusty Light', 'Knitwear', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Casual', 'Knitwear', 'Loose-fitting jumper in a soft cable knit with a ribbed polo neck, dropped shoulders, long sleeves and ribbing at the cuffs and hem. Gently rounded and slightly longer at the back.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0911449002', '0911449', 'SC ELEONOR Blazer', 'Blazer', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'Dark Turquoise', 'Medium', 'Studio Collection', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Unknown', 'Studio Collection. Fitted jacket in a slightly stretchy weave made from a wool blend with peak lapels and a one-button fastening at the front. Shoulder pads for a defined silhouette and long sleeves with buttons at the cuffs. Patch front pockets, one of which is a chest pocket, a gently tapered waist and a double back vent. Lined. Studio Collection AW20 is a tribute to the rebellious, fearless individual who dares to break the mould – an individual who plays between the extremes and finds their style amongst the androgynous, eclectic and creative.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0911454001', '0911454', 'SC Isabella Trouser', 'Trousers', 'Garment Lower body', 'Solid', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Studio Collection', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Unknown', 'Studio Collection. Slim-fit trousers in a stretch weave made from a wool blend with a regular waist, belt loops and a tailored waistband with a safety button on the inside. Zip fly and button, side pockets, welt back pockets with a button and slim, extra-long legs with a high slit and buttons at the hems. Studio Collection AW20 is a tribute to the rebellious, fearless individual who dares to break the mould – an individual who plays between the extremes and finds their style amongst the androgynous, eclectic and creative.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0911489001', '0911489', 'Flirty  Solina foot deco', 'Other accessories', 'Accessories', 'Solid', 'Gold', 'Bright', 'Jewellery Extended', 'Ladies Accessories', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Small accessories', 'Accessories', 'Foot jewellery in metal chain with a fixed, adjustable toe ring, a chain with decorative beads along the top of the foot and an adjustable ankle chain.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0911493001', '0911493', 'Mimmi blouse', 'Blouse', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'White', 'Light', 'Blouse', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Tailoring', 'Blouses', 'Blouse in an airy weave with a deep V-neck, double-layered panel at the front and gathered yoke at the back. Long sleeves, wide cuffs with covered buttons, and a rounded hem. Unlined.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0911493002', '0911493', 'Mimmi blouse', 'Blouse', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'Dark Green', 'Medium Dusty', 'Blouse', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Tailoring', 'Blouses', 'Blouse in an airy weave with a deep V-neck, double-layered panel at the front and gathered yoke at the back. Long sleeves, wide cuffs with covered buttons, and a rounded hem. Unlined.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0911521001', '0911521', 'Peony dress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'Solid', 'Dark Turquoise', 'Dark', 'Dress', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Tailoring', 'Dresses Ladies', 'Short, A-line dress in a pleated weave made partly from recycled polyester. Small frilled collar, an opening at the back with a covered button at the back of the neck and long sleeves with concealed elastication and a frill trim at the cuffs. Lined in fabric made partly from recycled polyester.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0911552001', '0911552', 'TALI sweater', 'Sweater', 'Garment Upper body', 'All over pattern', 'Green', 'Medium Dusty', 'Baby Exclusive', 'Baby Sizes 50-98', 'Baby/Children', 'Baby Essentials & Complements', 'Woven/Jersey/Knitted mix Baby', 'Baby Exclusive. Top in soft, organic cotton sweatshirt fabric with a narrow trim around the neckline and buttons at the back of the neck. Gently dropped shoulders, long sleeves and narrow elastication at the cuffs and hem.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0911552002', '0911552', 'TALI sweater', 'Sweater', 'Garment Upper body', 'Front print', 'Light Beige', 'Dusty Light', 'Baby Exclusive', 'Baby Sizes 50-98', 'Baby/Children', 'Baby Essentials & Complements', 'Woven/Jersey/Knitted mix Baby', 'Baby Exclusive. Top in soft, organic cotton sweatshirt fabric with a narrow trim around the neckline and buttons at the back of the neck. Gently dropped shoulders, long sleeves and narrow elastication at the cuffs and hem.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0911564001', '0911564', 'LAVENDER leggings 2P', 'Leggings/Tights', 'Garment Lower body', 'Solid', 'Light Pink', 'Dusty Light', 'Baby Exclusive', 'Baby Sizes 50-98', 'Baby/Children', 'Baby Essentials & Complements', 'Woven/Jersey/Knitted mix Baby', 'Baby Exclusive. Leggings in ribbed organic cotton jersey with an adjustable, elasticated waist and fake fly with decorative buttons.', NULL, 0, 0),
