('0913694001', '0913694', 'ED Berry dress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'All over pattern', 'Dark Orange', 'Bright', 'Woven top', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'H&M+', 'Blouses', 'Calf-length dress in a patterned viscose weave with a round neckline that has gathers at the front and a small opening with a covered button at the back of the neck. Short, elbow-length puff sleeves with narrow covered elastication and a gathered seam at the waist. Unlined.', NULL, 0, 0),
