('0917053002', '0917053', 'AUSSIE GRUNGE SHACKET', 'Jacket', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'Dark Grey', 'Dark', 'Outdoor/Blazers', 'Divided', 'Divided', 'Divided Collection', 'Outdoor', 'Kangol x H&M. Oversized shirt jacket in sturdy twill with a brushed finish. Collar, buttons down the front, and a yoke with a pleat and hanger loop at the back. Welt front pockets and flap chest pockets with a button. One of the chest pockets has a Kangol logo. Dropped shoulders, long sleeves with buttoned cuffs, and a rounded hem with slits in the sides. Quilted lining made from recycled polyester.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0917056001', '0917056', 'AUSSIE DUBLIN HOODED PUFFER', 'Jacket', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'Dark Yellow', 'Medium', 'Outdoor/Blazers', 'Divided', 'Divided', 'Divided Collection', 'Outdoor', 'Kangol x H&M. Short, padded jacket with a stand-up collar, padded hood and Kangol logo above the hem. Contrasting colour zip down the front, discreet front pockets with a concealed zip, and narrow elastication at the cuffs and hem. Recycled polyester lining.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0917084001', '0917084', 'Robbie 3p set', 'Hoodie', 'Garment Upper body', 'Mixed solid/pattern', 'Dark Grey', 'Dark', 'Kids Boy Jersey Basic', 'Children Sizes 92-140', 'Baby/Children', 'Boys Underwear & Basics', 'Jersey Basic', 'Set with a pair of joggers and a hoodie in lightweight sweatshirt fabric and a matching T-shirt in organic cotton jersey. Joggers with an elasticated, drawstring waist, discreet side pockets and ribbed hems. Hoodie with a kangaroo pocket and ribbing at the cuffs and hem. T-shirt with a narrow, ribbed trim around the neckline.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0917121001', '0917121', 'ARIEL MIDI', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'Check', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Dresses', 'Divided', 'Divided', 'Divided Collection', 'Dresses Ladies', 'Wide, calf-length dress in a crêpe weave with a round neckline and a small opening with ties at the back of the neck. Short puff sleeves with narrow elastication at the hems and a skirt with gathered tiers. Unlined.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0917172001', '0917172', 'Nicole GTL speed', 'Blouse', 'Garment Upper body', 'All over pattern', 'Off White', 'Dusty Light', 'Blouse', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Everyday Collection', 'Blouses', 'Fitted blouse in an airy cotton weave with a sweetheart neckline, gathers at the front and short puff sleeves with elastication around the shoulders and hems.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0917203001', '0917203', 'BRYSON PILE jacket', 'Sweater', 'Garment Upper body', 'Contrast', 'Dark Blue', 'Dark', 'Jersey Fancy', 'Menswear', 'Menswear', 'Contemporary Casual', 'Jersey Fancy', 'Jacket in soft faux shearling with a high collar, zip down the front and long sleeves with narrow elastication at the cuffs. Discreet pockets in the side seams and a zipped chest pocket in woven fabric. Unlined.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0917203003', '0917203', 'BRYSON PILE jacket', 'Sweater', 'Garment Upper body', 'Contrast', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Jersey Fancy', 'Menswear', 'Menswear', 'Contemporary Casual', 'Jersey Fancy', 'Jacket in soft faux shearling with a high collar, zip down the front and long sleeves with narrow elastication at the cuffs. Discreet pockets in the side seams and a zipped chest pocket in woven fabric. Unlined.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0917229001', '0917229', 'Pauline dress (J)', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'Solid', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Jersey', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Mama', 'Jersey Fancy', 'Calf-length dress in soft, ribbed jersey with a unique nursing feature. V-neck, short sleeves, a wide tie belt under the bust, and slits in the sides. The design includes a double layer to help retain warmth while allowing easier nursing access.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0917237001', '0917237', 'Sharon dress (RW)', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'All over pattern', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Woven Tops', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Mama', 'Blouses', 'Knee-length nursing dress in a patterned viscose weave with a double layer at the front and practical inner top for easier nursing access. Opening and button at the back of the neck, long sleeves with a flounce over the shoulders, and elastication and a frill trim at the cuffs. Elasticated seam at the waist and a gently flared skirt.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0917241001', '0917241', 'P Chelsey hood dress (J)', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'Solid', 'Dark Blue', 'Dark', 'Jersey', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Mama', 'Jersey Fancy', 'Knee-length dress in soft jersey with a unique nursing feature, a hood and long sleeves. The design includes a double layer to help retain warmth while allowing easier nursing access.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0917248001', '0917248', 'N Matia dress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'Solid', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Woven Tops', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Mama', 'Blouses', 'Short dress in an airy viscose weave with a unique nursing feature. Small, frilled collar and a V-shaped opening with ties at the neck. Long raglan sleeves with wide smocking at the cuffs. The design includes a double layer to help retain warmth while allowing easier nursing access.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0917258001', '0917258', 'Alicia seamless top (J)', 'Vest top', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Jersey', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Mama', 'Jersey Fancy', 'Nursing top in soft, stretch fabric with narrow, adjustable shoulder straps. Soft integral top with a functional fastening for easier nursing access and an elasticated hem. The top is designed with the minimum number of seams for a seamless, comfortable feel against the skin.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0917285001', '0917285', 'Trine knitted dress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'Melange', 'Dark Grey', 'Dark', 'Knitwear', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Mama', 'Knitwear', 'Dress in a soft, fine knit containing some wool with a V-neck and long raglan sleeves. Double layer at the top with a practical inner top for easier nursing access.', NULL, 0, 0),
