('0917297005', '0917297', 'BLANKS JERRY OVERSIZED HOOD', 'Hoodie', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'Yellowish Brown', 'Dark', 'Blanks', 'Menswear', 'Menswear', 'Men Underwear', 'Jersey Basic', 'Blank Staples is a streetwear collection of minimalistic pieces that are the perfect canvas for your personal style and creativity. This cosy hoodie is made from heavy, 460 gsm cotton sweatshirt fabric for a premium handfeel. In a straight cut and oversized for a relaxed fit, it has a double-layered, drawstring hood, kangaroo pocket, low dropped shoulders, long sleeves and ribbing at the cuffs and hem.', NULL, 0, 0),
