('0917321001', '0917321', 'Fernando Jumpsuit', 'Jumpsuit/Playsuit', 'Garment Full body', 'Solid', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Trouser', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Everyday Collection', 'Trousers', 'Jumpsuit in woven fabric with notch lapels and a wrapover front with a concealed press-stud. Defined shoulders, long sleeves and diagonal side pockets with a recycled polyester lining. Seam with a tie belt and button at the waist, a zip fly and straight, ankle-length legs with creases.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0917334001', '0917334', 'Sinner PU', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'Other structure', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Dress', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Everyday Collection', 'Dresses Ladies', 'Short, A-line dress in imitation leather with a large, frill-trimmed collar, buttons down the front and short, voluminous puff sleeves with narrow, buttoned cuffs. Unlined.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0917337001', '0917337', 'Melon', 'Cardigan', 'Garment Upper body', 'Melange', 'Beige', 'Medium Dusty', 'Knitwear', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Casual', 'Knitwear', 'Long cardigan in a soft knit containing some wool with dropped shoulders, long sleeves, patch front pockets and ribbing at the cuffs and hem. No buttons.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0917363001', '0917363', 'OF Giselle DIRNDL dress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'All over pattern', 'Light Beige', 'Dusty Light', 'Promotion/ Other /Offer', 'Divided', 'Divided', 'Divided Projects', 'Special Offers', 'Knee-length dirndl with a detachable apron. Sleeveless dress in woven fabric made from recycled polyester with darts and a concealed zip at the top and a deep neckline with a small frill trim in a contrasting colour. Seam at the waist and a gathered, flared skirt. Seersucker apron with wide ties and decorative satin ribbon trims at the hem. Lining in a recycled polyester and cotton blend.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0917397001', '0917397', 'Como Dress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'All over pattern', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Projects Dresses', 'Divided', 'Divided', 'Divided Projects', 'Dresses Ladies', 'Short dress in woven fabric with a small stand-up collar and frill-trimmed yoke with inset lace trims. Opening at the back with buttons at the back of the neck, wide sleeves with narrow elastication and a flounce at the cuffs, and concealed, narrow elastication at the waist. Unlined.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0917402001', '0917402', 'Sorrento Dress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'All over pattern', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Projects Dresses', 'Divided', 'Divided', 'Divided Projects', 'Dresses Ladies', 'Knee-length dress in an airy viscose weave with embroidery at the top and seams at the front with wide, gathered flounces that fall over the shoulders. Opening and button at the back of the neck and long sleeves with an opening and button at the cuffs. Seam with concealed elastication at the waist and a flared, airy skirt.', NULL, 0, 0),
