('0920591001', '0920591', 'TC - SHOE SHAME KIT', 'Stain remover spray', 'Garment and Shoe care', 'Solid', 'White', 'Light', 'Take care', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Collaborations', 'Unknown', 'A kit to help you care for your trainers and keep them fresh. Contains Shoe Shame cleaning gel and a double-sided brush. 150 ml. Instructions: Apply the gel and moisten the brush. Brush the surface gently and then wipe off (test on a small patch beforehand). Repeat if necessary. Air-dry.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0920592001', '0920592', 'TC - SHOE SHAME REMEMBER WHITE', 'Stain remover spray', 'Garment and Shoe care', 'Solid', 'White', 'Light', 'Take care', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Collaborations', 'Unknown', 'A covering colour to keep your trainers sparklingly white and fresh. Protects against UV-related discolouration. Bottle with a practical sponge applicator for ease of application. 100 ml. Instructions: First, clean your trainers. Then shake the bottle before use and apply to a dry surface. Air-dry. For leather trainers, you can polish to a fine shine.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0920602001', '0920602', 'TC - SHOE SHAME SHIELD', 'Clothing mist', 'Garment and Shoe care', 'Solid', 'White', 'Light', 'Take care', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Collaborations', 'Unknown', 'An impregnating spray that protects your shoes against dirt and water. Scent-free and suitable for all materials. 200 ml. Instructions: Shake the bottle before use and apply to a clean, dry surface (test on a small patch beforehand). Spray the entire surface until moist and then allow to dry. For best results repeat after 30 minutes. Allow to dry for 24 hours.', NULL, 0, 0),
