('0922848001', '0922848', 'Matilda 3pk body', 'Bodysuit', 'Garment Upper body', 'Other structure', 'Light Pink', 'Dusty Light', 'Baby Girl Jersey Fancy', 'Baby Sizes 50-98', 'Baby/Children', 'Baby Girl', 'Jersey Fancy', 'Long-sleeved bodysuits in soft cotton jersey with concealed press-studs at the back of the neck and press-studs at the crotch.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0922852001', '0922852', 'KENDRICK l/s', 'Sweater', 'Garment Upper body', 'All over pattern', 'Dark Turquoise', 'Medium', 'Young Boy Jersey Fancy', 'Children Sizes 134-170', 'Baby/Children', 'Young Boy', 'Jersey Fancy', 'Long-sleeved top in printed cotton jersey with ribbing around the neckline and short slits in the sides.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0922865001', '0922865', 'Five piece mixed set', 'Garment Set', 'Garment Full body', 'All over pattern', 'Light Pink', 'Dusty Light', 'Baby Girl Jersey Fancy', 'Baby Sizes 50-98', 'Baby/Children', 'Baby Girl', 'Jersey Fancy', 'Set with a dress, a sweatshirt, a top and two pairs of leggings in soft cotton. Dress in jersey with long sleeves and flounce trims at the top. Long-sleeved top in sweatshirt fabric with flounce trims. Dress and sweatshirt with a press-stud on one shoulder (except in sizes 1½-4Y). Long-sleeved top in jersey with an opening and button at the back of the neck. Leggings in jersey with covered elastication at the waist.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0922987001', '0922987', 'CARVER OVERSHIRT PRICE ITEM', 'Shirt', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'Off White', 'Dusty Light', 'Shirt', 'Menswear', 'Menswear', 'Contemporary Smart', 'Shirts', 'Shirt jacket in sturdy, washed cotton twill with a collar, contrasting colour buttons down the front and a yoke at the back. One open chest pocket, open patch front pockets and sleeves with a slit and adjustable buttoning at the cuffs. Straight-cut hem. Unlined. Regular Fit – a classic fit with good room for movement and a gently tapered waist to create a comfortable, tailored silhouette.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0923001001', '0923001', 'Sarah Low NASA BB', 'Sneakers', 'Shoes', 'Placement print', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Young Boy Shoes', 'Children Accessories, Swimwear', 'Baby/Children', 'Kids & Baby Shoes', 'Shoes', 'Trainers in cotton canvas with a text print on the side and soles. Padded edge, lacing at the front and a loop at the back. Mesh linings and insoles and patterned soles.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0923004001', '0923004', 'Svedka tencel culottes 1 RW', 'Trousers', 'Garment Lower body', 'Solid', 'Light Blue', 'Dusty Light', 'Trouser', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Casual', 'Trousers', 'Calf-length trousers in a soft Tencel™ lyocell weave with a high waist that has covered elastication at the back. Front pockets, fake back pockets and wide, straight legs.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0923010002', '0923010', 'ED Long leggings update', 'Leggings/Tights', 'Garment Lower body', 'Melange', 'Dark Grey', 'Dark', 'Jersey', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'H&M+', 'Jersey Fancy', 'Leggings in soft jersey. Regular waist with wide, covered elastication. The cotton content of the leggings is organic.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0923010003', '0923010', 'ED Long leggings update', 'Leggings/Tights', 'Garment Lower body', 'Solid', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Jersey', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'H&M+', 'Jersey Fancy', 'Leggings in soft jersey. Regular waist with wide, covered elastication. The cotton content of the leggings is organic.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0923020001', '0923020', 'FF Marre dress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'Lace', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Campaigns', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Everyday Collection', 'Special Offers', 'Calf-length, long-sleeved dress in lace made from recycled polyester with a stand-up collar and opening at the back with buttons at the back of the neck. V-shaped yoke with a wide, flounced trim front and back that continues over the sleeves. Asymmetric skirt for added width at the hem. Unlined.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0923028001', '0923028', 'FF Watson Coat', 'Jacket', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Campaigns', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Everyday Collection', 'Special Offers', 'Long, straight-cut, double-breasted coat in felted fabric made from recycled wool and recycled polyester. Wide notch lapels, dropped shoulders and long, wide sleeves that can be tightened with a tab and covered buckle at the cuffs. Diagonal welt front pockets and a single back vent. Lined in woven fabric made from recycled polyester.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0923028002', '0923028', 'FF Watson Coat', 'Jacket', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'Off White', 'Dusty Light', 'Campaigns', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Everyday Collection', 'Special Offers', 'Long, straight-cut, double-breasted coat in felted fabric made from recycled wool and recycled polyester. Wide notch lapels, dropped shoulders and long, wide sleeves that can be tightened with a tab and covered buckle at the cuffs. Diagonal welt front pockets and a single back vent. Lined in woven fabric made from recycled polyester.', NULL, 0, 0),
