('0927792005', '0927792', 'Hakuna top', 'Vest top', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'White', 'Light', 'Jersey', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Trend', 'Jersey Fancy', 'Cropped, fitted top in soft jersey with narrow, adjustable shoulder straps and a sweetheart neckline. Vertical seams with concealed elastication to create a draped effect and a concealed silicone trim top and bottom for best fit. Lined.', NULL, 0, 0),
