('0936548001', '0936548', 'ANIMAL ONESIE w baby', 'Costumes', 'Garment Full body', 'All over pattern', 'Light Beige', 'Dusty Light', 'Kids Dress-up/Football', 'Children Accessories, Swimwear', 'Baby/Children', 'Kids Accessories, Swimwear & D', 'Accessories', 'Soft pile fancy dress costume in the shape of a soft toy with a matching, padded baby. Kangaroo pocket with a space for the baby, a hood with ear appliqués on top and a zip down the front with a chin guard. Trims at the cuffs and hems.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0936594001', '0936594', 'Penny Essential 5PACK SET', 'Garment Set', 'Garment Full body', 'Solid', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Young Girl Jersey Basic', 'Children Sizes 134-170', 'Baby/Children', 'Girls Underwear & Basics', 'Jersey Basic', 'Basics set in soft, organic cotton jersey comprising two vest tops, two T-shirts and a pair of leggings. Vest tops with narrow shoulder straps. T-shirts with a rounded hem that is longer at the back. Leggings with an elasticated waist.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0936600001', '0936600', 'HW Bunny mask', 'Other accessories', 'Accessories', 'Solid', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Other items', 'Ladies Accessories', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Small accessories', 'Accessories', 'Moulded eye mask in velour-covered plastic with rabbit ears on top and an elastic strap at the back.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0936610001', '0936610', 'CLOVER DRESS', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'All over pattern', 'Orange', 'Medium', 'Dresses', 'Divided', 'Divided', 'Divided Collection', 'Dresses Ladies', 'Short chiffon dress with a smocked stand-up collar and flounces at the front that continue over the shoulders and down the back. Long sleeves with smocked cuffs, and a gathered seam at the waist and hem. Lined.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0936622001', '0936622', 'LW (J) consc PRICE jogger', 'Pyjama bottom', 'Nightwear', 'Solid', 'Light Beige', 'Dusty Light', 'Loungewear', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Nightwear, Socks & Tigh', 'Under-, Nightwear', 'Trousers in soft, organic cotton sweatshirt fabric. Regular waist with covered elastication and a drawstring, pockets in the side seams and tapered legs with covered elastication at the hems. Soft brushed inside.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0936637001', '0936637', 'PABLO MUSCLE MOCKNECK', 'Sweater', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Knitwear', 'Menswear', 'Menswear', 'Contemporary Smart', 'Knitwear', 'Jumper in a soft, rib-knit modal and cotton blend with a turtle neck and long sleeves. Muscle Fit – a fit designed to showcase the body’s physique with narrow shoulders, tapered sleeves and a sharply tapered waist to create a flattering silhouette.', NULL, 0, 0),
